# Pinned to tag v0.15.0 (commit 027be3349d20785efeb93f6773872a35497d7258),
# the latest stable release as of this writing -- see docs/site/README.md
# for the theme-selection rationale (hugo-book over Docsy: no Node/npm/
# Dart-Sass asset pipeline, Hugo's own multilingual mode provides the
# bilingual support, not a theme feature). Bump this pin deliberately,
# never implicitly via `git submodule update --remote`.
[submodule "docs/site/themes/hugo-book"]
	path = docs/site/themes/hugo-book
	url = https://github.com/alex-shpak/hugo-book
